        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_b9004e05c2264bfda044a85103c1b3b3",
      "statement": "Topic intervals disagree across sensorboard/README.md, firmware/shared/womo_config.h, and display/CLAUDE.md for imu, bat, bme_in/bme_out, and elec (only ctrl, tank, hx, and gas agree across all three); since espnow_modem.c's s_topics[] table includes womo_config.h's interval macros directly, womo_config.h is the value that actually ships at runtime, not either prose table.",
      "evidence": [
